      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The object system: the ObjectDef and ShapeDef registry, per-kind defs, text slots, outline geometry, the icon glyph registry, and the object-preference registry. The shape contract (what a def is, text slots, outlines and anchors, color roles) is owned by design. This area records the layout of "
        },
        {
          "insert": "objects/",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
