    "b-obj-glyphs-decision-21": {
      "id": "b-obj-glyphs-decision-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Decision",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ": icon glyphs are generated data joined to one hand-written registry. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "CANVAS_ICON_GLYPHS",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " in "
        },
        {
          "insert": "object-types.ts",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "packages/canvas/src/state/schema/object-types.ts",
              "label": "object-types.ts"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " is the single id list the validator, the registry, and the agent's vocabulary read. Three generated modules beside the icon def hold the geometry: the Nucleo glyphs from "
        },
        {
          "insert": "tools/nucleo-icons/generate.ts",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", and the Tabler outlines and Simple Icons logos from "
        },
        {
          "insert": "tools/dev-icons/generate.ts",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "tools/dev-icons/generate.ts",
              "label": "tools/dev-icons/generate.ts"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ". "
        },
        {
          "insert": "icon-glyphs.ts",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "packages/canvas/src/objects/shapes/icon/icon-glyphs.ts",
              "label": "icon-glyphs.ts"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " adds the labels, categories, and pack rules, and "
        },
        {
          "insert": "resolveIconGlyph(id, pack)",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " is the one theme-aware lookup every renderer and picker preview calls."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-obj-glyphs-why-22": {
      "id": "b-obj-glyphs-why-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Why",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ": generated geometry stays traceable to its upstream SVGs and can be re-vendored, and one id list means a glyph added to the roster validates, renders, and reaches the agent with no second list to keep in sync. The rejected alternative was hand-authored path data per glyph, which drifts from its source."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
